  "body": "An expansive, enduring family home that caters for your ever-evolving needs with harbour views, private lawns, a pool and a choice of sunny covered outdoor entertaining decks. Surrounded by multi-million-dollar properties, the impressive 4-bedroom plus office residence evokes a dreamy peaceful Hampton’s vibe. Think sophisticated tones, high ceilings, white plantation shutters throughout and an asphalt shingle roof. \r\n\r\nThe home was transformed with the help of an architect in a comprehensive high quality renovation 9 years ago. Every inch has been meticulously maintained. \r\n\r\nElevated living areas with high pitched ceilings catch all-day sun and reign over sweeping views. Rangitoto Island takes centre stage from the kitchen and dining room. The lounge extends to a balcony where you can watch the sun set behind the Sky tower, keeping an eye on children in the pool below. \r\n\r\nBedrooms on the ground floor all expand outdoors. The large master suite (with walk-in robe and ensuite) is positioned away from the guest suite and a children’s wing which has an office plus its own generous lounge opening to the pool and a tranquil oasis of garden and lawns. It’s the perfect scenario for families. Then a large versatile room off the double internal garage is ideal for a gym, pool or table tennis. \r\n\r\n• Elevated views of Rangitoto, the Waitemata Harbour & the Sky Tower\r\n• Cedar & weatherboard construction\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2 ensuites, powder room + family bathroom with bath\r\n• All rooms open to decks or the lawn\r\n• 2 lounges include a children’s lounge opening wide to the heated pool & lawn areas\r\n• Master bedroom & guest room with ensuite bathrooms\r\n• Gym or table tennis room off double internal garage\r\n• Lush well-maintained gardens\r\n• Very warm - 3 heat pumps, a gas fire in the upstairs lounge, underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n• St Thomas Primary & Selwyn College zones\r\n\r\nClose to great beaches and motorway connections, this sophisticated big family home is an immaculate, fun family playground that will keep both adults and children happy and entertained forever. Plan a lifetime of pleasure. A home to be enjoyed for generations.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
